        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR pushes three types of changes:</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">Front matter updates for BiDi pages: Includes <code class="notranslate">title</code> and <code class="notranslate">short-title</code> updates in <code class="notranslate">browser</code>, <code class="notranslate">session</code>, and <code class="notranslate">log</code> module pages.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">Titles now follow the format: "<code class="notranslate">command</code> command" or "<code class="notranslate">event</code> event".</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">The shorter short-titles help to keep the sidebar crisp without wrapping of long text.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">input</code> module is being updated in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4319700803" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43919" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/43919/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43919">#43919</a>.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role="table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Sidebar Before</th>
<th>Sidebar After</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
