<td><kbd><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/588560496-54362e84-95f3-4c02-ac53-bda90a5d886b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..pPfWFskdQm4rVvbS4eMwl4PLdOlqjeSd0piije6YeqY"><img width="240" height="385" alt="browser module in sidebar after changes" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/588560496-54362e84-95f3-4c02-ac53-bda90a5d886b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..pPfWFskdQm4rVvbS4eMwl4PLdOlqjeSd0piije6YeqY" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 385px;; aspect-ratio: 240 / 385; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px; display: block" class="js-gh-image-fallback"></a></kbd></td>
