</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Error code formatting: Similarly, <code class="notranslate">title</code> and <code class="notranslate">short-title</code> have been updated in the front matter of error pages.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds backticks to error code literals and fixes casing to lower case.</li>
<li>Titles now follow the format: "<code class="notranslate">error code</code> error code".</li>
