<p dir="auto"><kbd><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/588563186-82d5079b-88de-40de-befa-6c283ca26580.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..6aKBPH9bGHMpcbbcvxv0qv86p6grXql9O73lndAPA5s"><img width="240" height="228" alt="input module in sidebar after changes" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/588563186-82d5079b-88de-40de-befa-6c283ca26580.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..6aKBPH9bGHMpcbbcvxv0qv86p6grXql9O73lndAPA5s" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 228px;; aspect-ratio: 240 / 228; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px; display: block" class="js-gh-image-fallback"></a></kbd></p>
