<li>Inspired by <a href="https://css-tip.com/if-trick/" rel="nofollow">The Hidden Trick of Style Queries and <code class="notranslate">if()</code></a> by Temani Afif.</li>
<li>Related Firefox DevTools work: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2032963" rel="nofollow">bug 2032963</a>.</li>
</ul>]]></content>
