    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Reference HTML forms assessment features not covered in the tutorial]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44013</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44013"/>
        <updated>2026-05-05T12:53:51.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">As per <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4358242192" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43974/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974">#43974</a>, there are some features required for the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Test_your_skills/Forms_and_buttons" rel="nofollow">HTML forms assessment</a> solutions that are not covered in the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/HTML_forms" rel="nofollow">related tutorial</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">I've decided to fix this by making sure the required features are all referenced in the tutorial.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

